# Fitted models and the arrays the combine pipeline consumes are binary .npy
# blobs (model.npy ~tens of MB, inputs/msa.npy, synthetic/align_T*.npy). They
# travel Mac → Midway via Git-LFS so the trained models reach the cluster
# without bloating the git history. The run dirs they live in are explicitly
# un-ignored in .gitignore (results/CM-bm-dense/, results/PPIC-dense/).
results/**/*.npy filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
